{"server":"tw","storyId":"story_blackd_set_2_story_1","groupId":"story_blackd_set_2","stageId":null,"title":"健步如飛","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_blackd_2_1.txt","sourceHash":"9c9e3f603ab315dcd4569e3c6a23f8a4302e16f754082de00985321b4d9df507","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_rhodesroom"},{"type":"narration","text":"碎紙機邊，訊使手中拿著厚厚的一疊紙，封面寫著《謝拉格物流系統企劃案》。\n他的臉色有點凝重，似乎在猶豫些什麼，不過，最終他還是將手中的企劃案送向了碎紙機。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"avg_npc_990_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拜松……老師。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"avg_npc_990_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼要毀掉這份企劃案？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……因為這是一份不合格的企劃案。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"avg_npc_990_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是物流課的講師，你是我的學生，你的企劃案是否合格，可不是你說了算的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"avg_npc_990_1","isRemote":false,"text":"況且，你第一次告訴我，你要起草這份與謝拉格的物流系統有關的企劃案時，也不是現在這副表情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"avg_npc_990_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能讓我看看嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……請。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"avg_npc_990_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，很成熟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"avg_npc_990_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人力、成本、運輸方式、倉儲辦法……該考慮的，你都考慮到了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"avg_npc_990_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這份企劃案做得不錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"avg_npc_990_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是有一個問題還沒有解決——“真空地帶”上的工程問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝拉格和周邊國家存在實際控制區域間的“真空地帶”。"},{"type":"narration","text":"我"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而完善物流系統需要建設更完備的交通基礎設施，周邊國家是不會坐視謝拉格在“真空地帶”上肆意開發的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我發現，我無法解決這個問題，所以我打算放棄了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"avg_npc_990_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我沒記錯的話，我應該講過類似問題的解決方案。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"第一種，投資一家國際物流公司。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果用這種辦法的話，我根本沒有寫企劃案的必要，把一切都交給成熟的國際物流公司就好，比如——峯馳物流。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"avg_npc_990_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這一點我們也早就聊過了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"avg_npc_990_1","isRemote":false,"text":"峯馳物流在謝拉格的業務無法得到保障，除非有一個可靠的人來管理，比如——你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"avg_npc_990_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可惜你拒絕了。後悔了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那倒是——沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"第二種方法，離開謝拉格，建立一家屬於自己的物流公司。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"即使明眼人都看得出這家公司背後還是有謝拉格的影子，但是，只要它在名義上不屬於謝拉格，那麼，它受到的阻力必然要小很多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道，但是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"avg_npc_990_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是你不願意接受這個想法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"avg_npc_990_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就像你拒絕了我的招攬一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"avg_npc_990_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因為無論如何，這都意味著你需要離開喀蘭貿易，甚至有可能離開謝拉格。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"avg_npc_990_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你真正想毀掉的，是離開謝拉格的想法，對嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……等我回過神來，這份企劃案裡的各個方面，都是以由我管理為前提而設計的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是我為自己量身定製的企劃案，如果它要實施，就意味著，我會成為那個需要離開謝拉格的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我太自大了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"avg_npc_990_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你打算就這麼放棄這個企劃嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我會重新做一份企劃案交給老爺，請他去找適合的人選。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"avg_npc_990_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，你打算就這麼放棄這個機會嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"avg_npc_990_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道，謝拉格對你而言意義重大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"avg_npc_990_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，這同樣是一個讓你施展拳腳的機會，不是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"avg_npc_990_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你不想要這個機會的話——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"avg_npc_990_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你一開始又為什麼會選擇報名羅德島的課程來提升自己呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝你的好意，但我已經決定了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"拜松還沒反應過來，訊使已經從他手中取回了企劃案。\n但是當訊使準備再次將企劃案投入碎紙機時，背後響起了清脆的鳴叫聲。\n一隻羽獸以比他更迅捷的速度叼走了企劃案。這隻羽獸他再熟悉不過了——丹增。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……老爺。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"銀灰","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"魏斯，看來你最近的想法有些危險。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我……抱歉，老爺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"銀灰","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，我也有幾分好奇。所以，試著執行這份企劃案吧，魏斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"銀灰","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"地圖測繪、路線規劃、安撫村莊、人員調配……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"銀灰","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或許等你進行下去後就會發現，你以為非你不可的事，事實卻未必如此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我知道了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"銀灰","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"銀灰","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我會和你一起行動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，但是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"銀灰","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的手下不是有一支雪崩預警小隊嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"銀灰","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"把我當成其中的一員就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"銀灰","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也讓我近距離地看看，你到底有沒有自己所想的能力吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我知道了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"avg_npc_990_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……這樣真的好嗎，銀灰先生？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"銀灰","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"銀灰","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"魏斯，也到了該正視自己的時候了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_iceforest_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"銀灰","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"銀灰","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘶……呼……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……老爺，我來扶您一把。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"銀灰","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用。其他隊員呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們都已經到山頂了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以您現在的體能，完成這樣的跋涉可能比較困難。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"銀灰","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"魏斯，你是故意想把我趕回去，對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼會呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是您平時多在辦公室裡處理公務，體能比不上我們這種長期在外奔波的人也不奇怪，不是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"銀灰","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們在這裡休息一下吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"讓山頂的隊員等我們一下，想必他們也會理解的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"銀灰","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……走吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"銀灰","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不能因為我耽誤了測繪工作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"銀灰","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"銀灰","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你說得沒錯，我確實也有很長一段時間沒有走進山裡了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您小時候可是翻山越嶺的好手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"銀灰","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在這點上遺傳了母親。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"銀灰","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……現在不像了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在也像，只是您學會了掩飾自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"銀灰","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，我一直沒有告訴你，撿到你的那次，是她們姐妹兩個拉著我外出打獵，才遇到你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其實我早就知道了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"銀灰","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟兩位小姐的口風可沒有那麼緊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您只是那天偶然被兩位小姐硬拉著上山打獵，偶然和她們走散了，偶然遇到了我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"風雪那麼大，其實您當時也迷路了，對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然後，明明心裡也沒什麼把握的您強裝冷靜把我帶下了山，並帶回了希瓦艾什家的宅邸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最後，在我的祖父母找上門，請求大老爺收下自幼失去父母的我做僕人時，您以需要一個同性玩伴為由，說服了大老爺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我就這麼成為了希瓦艾什家的一員。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"銀灰","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……也許吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"銀灰","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"二老現在身體還好嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"託您的福，爺爺現在在圖里卡姆的老年活動中心可以說是呼風喚雨，奶奶也開了家小店，日子樂得清閒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"銀灰","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"銀灰","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對我來說，馬特洪是從一開始就效忠家族的衛士，他的存在太理所當然了。而你不一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"銀灰","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是我自己收服的人——至少我當時是這麼認為的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"銀灰","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且你的身手很敏捷。所以，有一段時間，我什麼消息都讓你幫我告訴別人，也讓別人透過你向我傳遞消息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"銀灰","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我其實只是想要炫耀你的存在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果您為此感到了愧疚，那大可不必。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對我來說，這也算是讓我找到了一些生存意義。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟，家族中忽然多出一個野孩子，許多人都覺得我很刺眼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您又怎麼知道，我沒有在這個過程中，藉著您的名義滿足了一些私欲呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"銀灰","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至少，你沒有讓我知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，真有您的風格。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"況且——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一開始，我確實不覺得在山間奔走有什麼樂趣可言。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，久而久之，當我走過那些樹林、那些山道——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g1_snowyforest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當我踏上雪山之巔——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當我呼吸著山頂的空氣，當我看著遠處的山峰與碧藍的天空構成一幅絕景——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我覺得很快樂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我逐漸喜歡上了這種感覺。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"謝拉格戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_284_1","isRemote":false,"text":"隊長、老……銀灰隊員，你們來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"匯報情況。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"謝拉格戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_284_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們有一個好消息和一個壞消息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先說好消息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"謝拉格戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_284_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這一處山峰是勘測行動預定的最後一處，就在剛才，我們已經繪製出了謝拉格和周邊國家之間的“真空地帶”的地貌圖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"謝拉格戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_284_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“真空地帶”上所有獨立村莊的位置也已經確定了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"謝拉格戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_284_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在能夠說服這些村莊作為中轉站和倉儲站的前提下，專家組設計出了一條最有效率且最節約成本的物流路線。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"壞消息呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"學者","speakerId":"avg_npc_271_1","isRemote":false,"text":"壞消息是……雖然路線規劃實際上已經接近完成了，結合成本和時間考慮，大致上也都在接受範圍內……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"學者","speakerId":"avg_npc_271_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，我們拿著方案去和每一座村莊都談過，有些同意了，有些卻沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這倒也在預料之內。都有哪些村子？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"學者","speakerId":"avg_npc_271_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請看這裡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"學者","speakerId":"avg_npc_271_1","isRemote":false,"text":"分別是這幾座村子，尤其是這座。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"學者","speakerId":"avg_npc_271_1","isRemote":false,"text":"村裡人對外人的態度不太好，村長倒是能說上話，但也被其他人的意見搞得有些下不了台。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咦……這座村子是——"},{"type":"narration","text":"……\n收隊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"銀灰","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要放棄了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我要先回一趟圖里卡姆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在那裡，有我們說服那些村民的鑰匙。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"45_g1_kjeragtrainstation"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車站職員","speakerId":"avg_npc_277_1","isRemote":false,"text":"魏斯先生，您是說……為了建立那條物流通道，您需要說服村民們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車站職員","speakerId":"avg_npc_277_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，您需要我向我的父親寫一封信？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟你的父親是村中的智者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，如果你不願意的話，我們也不勉強。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"剛才，我已經把這件事的風險和收益都告訴你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車站職員","speakerId":"avg_npc_277_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我當然願意！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車站職員","speakerId":"avg_npc_277_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果不是您當年的引薦，我也不會來到謝拉格，在這個車站裡找到這麼好的工作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車站職員","speakerId":"avg_npc_277_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，如果按照您說的，能夠在謝拉格周邊建立那樣一條物流通道，那簡直跟做夢一樣！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車站職員","speakerId":"avg_npc_277_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我這就寫！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車站職員","speakerId":"avg_npc_277_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你應該也有一段時間沒回家了吧，順便準備一些你想帶給家人的東西吧，我幫你一起送過去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車站職員","speakerId":"avg_npc_277_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這……怎麼好意思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別客氣，外面的村莊和謝拉格的聯繫本來就不緊密，經常得不到補給。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，這也能增加一些說服你父親的機率。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車站職員","speakerId":"avg_npc_277_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道了……那我就不客氣了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"銀灰","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看來，你和圖里卡姆車站裡的人很熟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟，這裡已經是整個謝拉格所有信件和貨物的中轉站了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我很喜歡這裡的氣氛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"銀灰","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這也是你在羅德島選擇進修物流課程的原因嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我喜歡在山間奔走的感覺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也喜歡看到將訊息、信件、貨物送到它們的主人手中時，對方臉上露出的表情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無論那是您的表情，還是其他人的表情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也無論那是喜悅的表情、痛苦的表情，還是悲傷的表情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也許那只是您在我童年時的無心之舉——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我確實喜歡上了這種感覺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是把人與人連接起來的感覺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一開始，我並不理解您沒有幫我和角峰大哥在喀蘭貿易中安排具體工作的意圖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但久而久之，我逐漸明白了您的想法——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您想要讓我們自己選擇自己的未來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"銀灰","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我從不認為，我是你們的主人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"銀灰","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我也從來沒有想過，要決定你們的未來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但您從來不主動告訴別人您的想法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一路上，我一直在想，您是為了什麼而來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無論是為了挽留我，還是趕我走，似乎都不值得您走這一趟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在，我有些明白了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"銀灰","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說說看？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在，還不是時候。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，您也許忘了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在要去的這座村子，我們在十幾年前去過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"銀灰","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車站職員","speakerId":"avg_npc_277_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我寫好了，魏斯先生！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車站職員","speakerId":"avg_npc_277_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有，這些是我想要帶給家人的東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車站職員","speakerId":"avg_npc_277_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，東西可能確實有點多，您要是覺得不適合——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒事，就交給這邊這位先生吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"銀灰","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車站職員","speakerId":"avg_npc_277_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咦，但是，這不是恩希歐迪斯老爺——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，他現在是謝拉格探險團的一員，而我，是團長。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"銀灰","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……原來如此，我記起來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"銀灰","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我來拿吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車站職員","speakerId":"avg_npc_277_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那、那就麻煩您了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"銀灰","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……好重。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snowconutry_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村中老者","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"你們……是誰？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"智者愛德懷茲，您忘了我嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是謝拉格探險團團長，魏斯。這是我的勇士，馬特洪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村中老者","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"噢——對了對了，我記得你們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"馬特洪，你也來和智者打個招呼吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"馬特洪？","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"智者，久疏問候。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村中老者","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"好，好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村中老者","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"當時還以為你們是不知道哪裡來的野人，結果沒想到居然是謝拉格的使者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村中老者","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"我的那個傻兒子克里斯，他在謝拉格過得還好嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"馬特洪？","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"智者，我們這次過來，就是為了將克里斯的信送給您。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"馬特洪？","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有這些……是他為家人準備的禮物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村中老者","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"這、這是……那個小子，準備了這麼多的東西嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"馬特洪？","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（低聲）嘶——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（低聲）老爺，辛苦您了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"馬特洪？","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（低聲）無妨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"克里斯在謝拉格過得很好，他馬上就要晉升主管了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您讀一下他的信吧，信裡也有我們這次的來意。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村中老者","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村中老者","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"你們的來意我知道了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村中老者","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"進屋聊吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snowconutry_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然如此，村裡人就拜託您去說服了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村中老者","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"這件事可不小啊，我得和他們商量商量。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村中老者","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"不過你放心，有克里斯的信，還有你們做擔保，相信他們也會同意的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果需要我們出面的話，請儘管告訴我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村中老者","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"好，好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老爺，您現在記起來了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"銀灰","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你一路讓我提了那麼久的東西，我怎麼可能還記不起來？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我這也是想讓您感受一下物流通道的重要性。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"況且，我不也幫您分擔了一半嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"銀灰","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那時有一天，我上完了課，忽然想去看看外面的樣子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"銀灰","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"於是就拉著你偷偷跳上了下山的運輸車。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那天可真是把我嚇壞了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"銀灰","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其實，一開始我是想拉上馬特洪的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"銀灰","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我覺得他一定會反對，而且會攔住我，所以只找了你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼您覺得我不會阻止您？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"銀灰","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因為你以前就是那種不會制止別人做蠢事的人，即使那是我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"銀灰","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，你也一直很想出去看看，不是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，等我們下了山，卻發現外面只有一片荒野的時候，我可是跟您說了我們該回頭的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是您不願意聽而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"銀灰","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"回去也是挨母親的罵，不如往前多走走看看，說不定有驚喜啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要不是我出來的時候從廚房裡偷了些乾糧，我們沒走半天就要餓死了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我那時候心裡可是相當埋怨您的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"銀灰","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不是說你一直很感謝我的救命之恩嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是沒有人願意餓死在荒野裡吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"銀灰","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"確實，我也不願意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"銀灰","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，等到乾糧吃完的時候，我也後悔了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"幸好我們找到了這座村子，那時還沒長白髮的愛德懷茲正在門口掃雪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您還記得嗎，他差點把我們當野人打出去呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"銀灰","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我記得。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"銀灰","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為了穩住他，你情急之下編出了一個探險團的名號，還說你是團長。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"銀灰","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"結果他還真的信了，把我們招待進屋，請我們喝了熱瘤奶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"銀灰","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你那時是怎麼想的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那時候，大老爺已經告訴過我有人在盯著希瓦艾什家，我想，不能隨便報出家族的名號。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，領頭的人容易被盯上，所以我才主動說自己是團長。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我當時還覺得這個點子好極了，現在想起來，真是幼稚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"銀灰","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒關係，當時我也覺得你這個點子好極了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"銀灰","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"否則，我也不會自稱是你麾下最勇敢的戰士了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"narration","text":"不知為何，訊使沉默了一下。\n他轉頭看向一個方向，那是謝拉格的方向。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"回去之後，我們被大夫人處罰，不准進屋吃飯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"銀灰","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那可能是母親對我進行過最嚴重的處罰了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"銀灰","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我現在還記得母親一邊哭一邊說的話——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"銀灰","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“這麼喜歡往冰天雪地裡跑，那你們兩個接下來就站在外面吃飯吧！”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"確實。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"結果，第一天是恩雅小姐為我們送飯，第二天是恩希亞小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"第三天，大老爺乾脆站在外面跟我們一起吃飯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大夫人最後只能放我們進屋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"銀灰","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"母親一直把你當成另一個孩子，我也把你當作兄弟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也徹底知道了您是為何而來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"銀灰","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為了什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您是為了告訴我，您不會忘記我和希瓦艾什的羈絆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也是為了親耳聽到我說出，我心中的答案。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"銀灰","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，你的答案是什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的答案是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那份企劃案並不是我自大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就是只有我能做到的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老爺，我請求離開謝拉格。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"21_G3_victoria_street_d"},{"type":"narration","text":"前面就是公司註冊局了。\n訊使握緊了手中的各種資料，嚥了嚥口水。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"銀灰","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你現在，就像當年猶豫要不要敲開開斯特家族大門的我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您當時也害怕嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"銀灰","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"害怕？我在期待，期待門後有什麼驚喜在等著我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我做過許多大膽的事，我也認為，為您出力的方法有許多種。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是唯獨離開謝拉格，我曾以為我永遠不會去做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"銀灰","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我曾經以為，是出於忠誠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"銀灰","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人人都說，有魏斯和馬特洪這樣的忠臣是我的福氣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"銀灰","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們卻不知道，我並不喜歡一味愚忠的手下；而我任用你們，也並不只是因為你們對我忠誠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"銀灰","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你只是總和我想得相似，而我僥倖還沒有行差踏錯過，不是嗎，魏斯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……或許確實是這樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"銀灰","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我所認識的魏斯，並不只是一個溫柔善良的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"銀灰","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他看著一切發生，並把一切藏在心裡，旁人以為他毫無想法，卻不知道，他早有答案。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您知道我的答案嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"銀灰","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只知道，這一次，我們所想依然相差不遠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您和我都知道，在這件事上，我是唯一的人選。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是不確定自己是不是應該邁出這一步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而您費這麼大的功夫，陪我跑這一趟，只是為了告訴我——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您知道，您也記得。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您是來為我送行的，是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"銀灰","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在等雪山上最矯健的依特拉，有一天終於鼓起勇氣走下雪山，前往更開闊的天地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您會失去一個最忠心的部下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"銀灰","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我會獲得一個新的朋友、有趣的盟友、值得挑戰的競爭對手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老爺，這大概是我最後一次叫您老爺了。我會離開您的身邊，離開希瓦艾什家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我會去成立一家新的物流公司。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這家公司不會在謝拉格註冊。它會和峯馳物流合作，開發謝拉格周邊“真空地帶”的物流路線。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"未來，這家公司也不會只局限於物流，它會參與建設發展“真空地帶”上的村莊，改善謝拉格週邊的交通。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說不定在不遠的未來，它會在謝拉格週邊建立起一座移動城市呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"銀灰","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，它會是喀蘭貿易的朋友，還是敵人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只能保證，它會是謝拉格的朋友。商場上沒有絕對的朋友和敵人，您教我的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"銀灰","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你能說服拜松跟你合作？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一個值得合作的夥伴和一個無法確認忠誠的手下，他會明白怎麼選的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"銀灰","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在謝拉格之外，我的名字可不好用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在您身邊學了這麼久，又在羅德島學到很多，暫時應該還是夠用的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"銀灰","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"銀灰","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……恩希亞這下又要埋怨我把人往外趕了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是您咎由自取。當然，我的家就在希瓦艾什的宅邸，偶爾回家看看總不會有人說些什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"銀灰","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，這家公司，謝拉格未來的新朋友，它的名字叫什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就叫——“訊使物流”吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
